[recipe-name]
alt-lds=Bio-enchanced low density structures
alt-rocket-fuel=Catalytic rocket fuel
alt-processor=Shielded processing units

[recipe-description]
alt-lds=Using bacteria in combination with bioflux lets creating biologically supported and strong structure for lower cost.
alt-rocket-fuel=By using the catalityc reaction between lithium, sulfuric acid and solid fuel we can create microchambers of said ingridients using solid fuel as an easily breakable barrier for starting a chain reaction.
alt-processor=Because of cosmic radiation processing units needed way more memory than actually needed. by shielding our units with holmium solution we can use way less ingridients per unit.